      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Titanium is a rare and highly valuable metal found on Venus, forged by
    the planet\u2019s intense heat, crushing pressure, and volcanic activity. Titanium
    deposits are often linked to volcanic rock and deep-crust formations, where extreme
    conditions allow this lightweight yet incredibly strong metal to form alongside
    other heavy elements. Despite Venus\u2019s harsh environment, titanium stands
    out for its exceptional resistance to heat, corrosion, and structural stress,
    making it ideal for surviving extreme conditions. Once refined, titanium is used
    to craft high strength alloys, advanced armor, reinforced structures, and high-end
    machinery."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
