      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to Earth our vibrant blue world teeming with life, diverse landscapes,
    and ever-changing wonders. Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only
    known place in the universe where life thrives, thanks to its perfect blend of
    atmosphere, liquid water, and protective magnetic field. It spins once every
    24 hours, giving us day and night, and orbits the Sun in about 365 days, shaping
    the seasons. From vast oceans covering over 70% of its surface to towering mountains,
    lush forests, and sprawling deserts, Earth\u2019s environments are incredibly
    varied and rich. Its atmosphere, made mostly of nitrogen and oxygen, lets us
    breathe and shields us from harmful space radiation. Earth is also home to billions
    of species from microscopic organisms to massive whales and nearly 8 billion
    humans who have built civilizations, cultures, and technologies across thousands
    of years. Constantly shifting through tectonic plates, weather patterns, and
    natural cycles, Earth is a dynamic, living planet full of beauty, mystery, and
    adventure, making it an exciting and compelling location for any game world."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
